§§ `נספח א' — כתב הצטרפות`

-- akn:attachments The annexes: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 The form's title, its date left blank; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 "To"; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 The chief labour-relations officer; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 The Ministry of Labour and Welfare; no rule.
